{
  "_comment": "IncidentClock design requirements for the Phase 5 milestone and the tests that evaluate each. Source of coverage.model in the tester's suite report when it tests this team's own system (OWN_SYSTEM_URLS). Each requirement is a checkable statement from a model in docs/models.md. Tests are pytest function names in tests/; tester_tests/test_design_mapping.py fails CI if a name does not exist or a requirement has no test. Human-readable table: docs/design-requirements.md (generated by scripts/design_mapping.py).",
  "design_version": "IncidentClock design v5.0 (docs/models.md, Phase 5)",
